      <transcript>DEGERENGGYI</transcript>
      <definition>adj. and n. Supercilious, haughty, arrogant, conceited, presumptuous; haughtiness, pride, presumption, arrogance.</definition>
      <page>244</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠠᠺᠠᠷᠠᠩᠺᠥᠢ ᠰᠡᠳᠺᠢᠯᠲᠡᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- sedkiltei</transcript>
          <definition> Arrogant.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠠᠺᠠᠷᠠᠩᠺᠥᠢ ᠵᠠᠩ ᠭᠠᠷᠭᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- zang γarγaxu</transcript>
          <definition> To display arrogance.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠦᠨᠳᠦᠰᠦᠨ ᠤ ᠳᠠᠺᠠᠷᠠᠩᠺᠥᠢ ᠶᠠᠪᠤᠭᠤᠯᠤᠯᠭ᠎ᠠ</unicode>
